    "detailed_description": "<ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> New science fiction story: do optional quests and even optional main quests in a modern world. All dialogue can be skipped and restored to a certain extent. Based on a three book story.<br></li><li> Larinite's turn-based combat: against enemies and bosses. Clarity in combat.<br></li><li> Many choices in combat: character classes, pets, consumables and equipment.<br></li><li> Exploration and creature collection: explore the world and collect creatures. One pet from every element to choose from as your starter pet (there are only 8 elements).<br></li><li> Design: your own home and choose what your private city will be like.<br></li><li> Many non-combat skills: to work on such as fishing, cooking and metalworking.<br></li><li> Reputation (community relationship) system: for NPCs with unique rewards.<br></li><li> Larinite's randomness safeguard: allows for different runs and outcomes, and prevents too much repetition.</li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> New science fiction story: do optional quests and even optional main quests in a modern world. All dialogue can be skipped and restored to a certain extent. Based on a three book story.<br></li><li> Larinite's turn-based combat: against enemies and bosses. Clarity in combat.<br></li><li> Many choices in combat: character classes, pets, consumables and equipment.<br></li><li> Exploration and creature collection: explore the world and collect creatures. One pet from every element to choose from as your starter pet (there are only 8 elements).<br></li><li> Design: your own home and choose what your private city will be like.<br></li><li> Many non-combat skills: to work on such as fishing, cooking and metalworking.<br></li><li> Reputation (community relationship) system: for NPCs with unique rewards.<br></li><li> Larinite's randomness safeguard: allows for different runs and outcomes, and prevents too much repetition.</li></ul>",
    "short_description": "An open world RPG based on an original three book story. Beat bosses, capture creatures, or progress through the game with your non-combat skills such as fishing. Do quests to change your reputation among the people of Meno, or just explore the world and make new discoveries- the choice is yours!",
    "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support",
